  "bodyHash": "5df0bd41a9ea95f5",
  "content": "\n\n<p>新增可愛又獨特的大氣生物，強化整體美學氛圍。</p>\n<p>此為客戶端模組。無需安裝在伺服器上。</p>\n<p>所有效果均可單獨停用或設定：使用指令&nbsp;<code>/cosycritters</code> 或模組列表選單。</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:682px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/YatkJsCc11s\" width=\"682\" height=\"399\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<h1>愜意小動物</h1>\n<h3>鳥類</h3>\n<p>鳥群會在天空中成群飛行，偶爾會降落於方塊上，偏好位置較高的地方。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/61PI8Hzj/images/c95a14d31a57d469982556d3af4e08c86aa12342.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>當附近有載具、生物或投射物等實體干擾時，鳥群會飛起並四散。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/61PI8Hzj/images/4e06f4e46bdc17ec0a688b479b6f53e74def077b.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3>飛蛾</h3>\n<p>會圍繞任何&nbsp;<strong>暴露於天空下的光源方塊</strong>&nbsp;。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1182393/description_af4217f0-a748-4b05-a02f-b8b409af2f8b.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h1>爬行小蟲</h1>\n<h3>迷你蜘蛛</h3>\n<p>會從<strong>蜘蛛網</strong>中爬出，沿著牆壁、地板和天花板移動。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1182393/description_84d680ca-1253-43d3-87ef-60dc51f51afc.gif\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<h3>戴帽人</h3>\n<p>睡覺時有小機率出現。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1182393/description_19a13a65-e1ad-4825-b03d-bfa461160ea1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"250\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4>其他連結</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpigc.art%252fdiscord\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/PigCart/cosy-critters/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">更新日誌</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://github.com/PigCart/cosy-critters/issues?q=is:issue\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">問題追蹤</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcosy-critters\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></li>\n</ul>",
